---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<section class="section" id="que-es">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="art reveal">
      <div class="arch-diagram panel">
        <div class="arch-header mono">
          <div class="status-pill">
            <span class="pulsing-led"></span>
            <span>SOCKET SEMTECH UDP/1700</span>
          </div>
          <span class="arch-badge">COPIA PASIVA</span>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-flow">
          <!-- Entrada: Nodos y Gateway -->
          <div class="flow-origin">
            <div class="node-box">
              <span class="node-type mono">DISPOSITIVOS DE CAMPO</span>
              <strong>Nodos Heltec v4 + BME280</strong>
              <small>Uplinks ambientales · Plan AU915</small>
            </div>
            <div class="connector-arrow">
              <span class="connector-line"></span>
              <span class="connector-label mono">RF LoRaWAN</span>
            </div>
            <div class="node-box gateway">
              <span class="node-type mono">CONCENTRADOR</span>
              <strong>Gateway SenseCAP M2</strong>
              <small>Forwarder UDP/1700</small>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Bifurcación -->
          <div class="bifurcation-marker">
            <div class="split-label mono">
              <span>PUNTO DE OBSERVACIÓN DESACOPLADO</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Dos Rutas Paralelas -->
          <div class="dual-paths">
            <!-- Ruta 1: Operativa (con descarte) -->
            <div class="path-card path-discard">
              <div class="path-tag mono">RUTA OPERATIVA (CHIRPSTACK)</div>
              <div class="path-steps">
                <span class="path-step">Gateway Bridge (MQTT)</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">↓</span>
                <span class="path-step">Network Server (ChirpStack)</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">↓</span>
                <span class="path-step">Aplicación de Monitoreo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="path-footer warning mono">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2L1 21h22L12 2zm0 3.5L20.3 19H3.7L12 5.5zM11 10v4h2v-4h-2zm0 6v2h2v-2h-2z"/></svg>
                <span>Descarta tramas anómalas o replay: pérdida de evidencia</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Ruta 2: Forense (Preservación) -->
            <div class="path-card path-forensic">
              <div class="path-tag mono">RUTA FORENSE DESACOPLADA</div>
              <div class="path-steps">
                <span class="path-step">Captura local (tcpdump + supervisor)</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">↓</span>
                <span class="path-step">Originales PCAP + SHA-256</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">↓</span>
                <span class="path-step">Gemelo Digital (Evaluación de estados)</span>
                <span class="path-arrow">↓</span>
                <span class="path-step">Paquetes verificables (Firma Ed25519)</span>
              </div>
              <div class="path-footer success mono">
                <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg>
                <span>Preservación inmutable antes del descarte</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-legend mono">
          <span>* Basado en la arquitectura experimental de la tesis (Fig. 17)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow reveal">Problemática & Solución</span>
      <h2 class="reveal" data-delay="1">Preservar la evidencia que el <span class="gradient-text">Network Server descarta</span></h2>
      <p class="reveal" data-delay="2">
        En despliegues agroindustriales (silobolsas y plantas de acopio), la manipulación de variables como temperatura y humedad puede causar pérdidas millonarias. Sin embargo, ante un incidente, los servidores tradicionales como <strong>ChirpStack</strong> descartan tramas anómalas o duplicadas por diseño, destruyendo la evidencia del ataque.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal muted" data-delay="2">
        El <strong>prototipo forense</strong> introduce una arquitectura desacoplada y no intrusiva: intercepta pasivamente el socket UDP/1700 antes del Gateway Bridge, genera un <strong>gemelo digital</strong> que modela el comportamiento esperado del dispositivo (cadencia, contadores de trama y rangos físicos) y sella los paquetes originales con hashes SHA-256 y firmas Ed25519 con cadena de custodia.
      </p>

      <div class="key-facts reveal" data-delay="3">
        <div class="fact-item">
          <span class="fact-title mono">NO INTRUSIVO</span>
          <span class="fact-desc">Comprobada continuidad operativa de la red en ensayos A/B/A sin alteración del tráfico.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-item">
          <span class="fact-title mono">REPLAY CONTROLADO</span>
          <span class="fact-desc">Validado ante repetición de tramas con nodo Heltec atacante y prueba de ingesta UDP sintética.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="notice reveal" data-delay="3" role="note">
        <div class="notice-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 3 2 21h20L12 3z"/><path d="M12 10v5M12 18h.01"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Principio forense fundamental:</strong>
          Una anomalía es un indicio que requiere investigación técnica; no confirma por sí sola un ataque ni constituye prueba concluyente sin correlación.
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); align-items: center; }
  
  /* Diagrama de Arquitectura */
  .arch-diagram {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.75);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  
  .arch-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .status-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .pulsing-led {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--teal);
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--teal);
    animation: ledPulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
  }
  @keyframes ledPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(0.85); } }
  .arch-badge {
    background: rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--cyan);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .arch-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }

  .flow-origin {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .node-box {
    background: rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.8);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.8rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .node-box.gateway {
    border-color: rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.4);
    background: rgba(16, 28, 48, 0.9);
  }
  .node-type { font-size: 0.62rem; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
  .node-box strong { font-size: 0.88rem; color: #fff; }
  .node-box small { font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }

  .connector-arrow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }
  .connector-line {
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--line), var(--cyan));
    position: relative;
  }
  .connector-line::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    top: -3px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 4px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--cyan);
  }
  .connector-label { font-size: 0.6rem; color: var(--cyan); letter-spacing: 0.05em; white-space: nowrap; }

  .bifurcation-marker {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
  }
  .split-label {
    background: rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.9);
    border: 1px dashed var(--cyan);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(94, 231, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .dual-paths {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .path-card {
    background: rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.5);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.7rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .path-discard {
    border-color: rgba(255, 93, 115, 0.35);
    background: rgba(30, 16, 24, 0.4);
  }
  .path-forensic {
    border-color: rgba(60, 242, 192, 0.45);
    background: rgba(10, 32, 38, 0.45);
  }

  .path-tag {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .path-discard .path-tag { color: var(--red); }
  .path-forensic .path-tag { color: var(--teal); }

  .path-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .path-step {
    background: rgba(5, 8, 15, 0.6);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  .path-discard .path-step { border-left-color: rgba(255, 93, 115, 0.5); }
  .path-forensic .path-step { border-left-color: var(--teal); font-weight: 500; }
  .path-arrow {
    align-self: center;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .path-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .path-footer.warning { color: #ff9ea8; }
  .path-footer.warning svg { color: var(--red); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }
  .path-footer.success { color: #a2f8de; }
  .path-footer.success svg { color: var(--teal); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

  .arch-legend {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-align: right;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .muted { color: var(--muted); }

  .key-facts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .fact-item {
    background: rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.6);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--cyan);
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
  }
  .fact-title { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .fact-desc { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4; display: block; }

  .notice {
    display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 1.8rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem; border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255, 181, 71, 0.12), rgba(255, 181, 71, 0.03));
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 181, 71, 0.35);
    color: #f6e3c3;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .notice strong { color: var(--amber); margin-right: 0.3rem; }
  .notice-icon { color: var(--amber); flex: none; margin-top: 2px; }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .art { order: 2; }
    .copy { order: 1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .flow-origin { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .connector-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); margin: 0.4rem 0; }
    .dual-paths { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .key-facts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
